  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/08/IMG_4512.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">222 fotos de la jornada taurina de la tarde del domingo en la fiestas de Toga, con el toro del pueblo, un cuernicorto de la ganader&iacute;a de Moreno Lemoche, de nombre Divertido, comprado por el Ayuntamiento y acompa&ntilde;ado del ganado de Armando Beltr&aacute;n, patrocinado por la pe&ntilde;a Choto Modorro,que tambi&eacute;n patrocin&oacute; la embolada de la noche. Este martes es el d&iacute;a grande, dedicado al Cristo de la Agon&iacute;a.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestastoga15domingo/img_4293.jpg\" alt=\"img_4293\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestastoga15domingo/img_4294.jpg\" alt=\"img_4294\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestastoga15domingo/img_4295.jpg\" alt=\"img_4295\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestastoga15domingo/img_4297.jpg\" alt=\"img_4297\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestastoga15domingo/img_4298.jpg\" alt=\"img_4298\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestastoga15domingo/img_4299.jpg\" alt=\"img_4299\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestastoga15domingo/img_4300.jpg\" alt=\"img_4300\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestastoga15domingo/img_4301.jpg\" alt=\"img_4301\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img sr